---
/**
 * SiteFooter — the site-wide footer: the starlight-ui-tweaks footer plus a
 * short disclaimer and copyright, on every page.
 *
 * Why a wrapper: starlight-ui-tweaks draws its four-column footer only on pages
 * whose template is not "doc" (the home page), and falls back to Starlight's
 * plain footer on all the doc pages. Wrapping it means the disclaimer appears
 * on both kinds of page without touching the plugin.
 *
 * The wording is a short echo of the Terms of Use and must not say more than
 * they do. If the Terms change, change this text with them. Spanish line first
 * in lang="es" so screen readers switch voice.
 *
 * The copyright line is drawn here only on doc pages; on the home page the
 * plugin already prints it (its text comes from `footer.copyright` in
 * astro.config.mjs). Keep the two texts identical.
 */
import UiTweaksFooter from 'starlight-ui-tweaks/overrides/Footer.astro';

const { template } = Astro.locals.starlightRoute.entry.data;
const showCopyright = template === 'doc';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<UiTweaksFooter />

<aside class="site-disclaimer" aria-label="Disclaimer / Aviso">
    <p>
        Pepa is experimental software and a personal research project. It is not a medical device,
        an alarm, or an emergency system, and nothing here is medical, legal, or technical advice.
        In an emergency, call 911.
    </p>
    <p>
        Some content and images are AI-generated and labelled as such; they may contain errors.
        Provided as-is, use at your own risk. See the <a href="/general/termsofuse/">Terms of Use</a>{' '}
        and <a href="/general/privacypolicy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>

    <p lang="es">
        Pepa es software experimental y un proyecto personal de investigación. No es un dispositivo
        médico, ni una alarma, ni un sistema de emergencia, y nada aquí constituye consejo médico,
        legal ni técnico. En una emergencia, llama al 911.
    </p>
    <p lang="es">
        Parte del contenido y de las imágenes se genera con IA y se identifica como tal; puede
        contener errores. Se ofrece tal cual, bajo tu propio riesgo. Consulta los{' '}
        <a href="/general/termsofuse/">Términos de Uso</a> y la{' '}
        <a href="/general/privacypolicy/">Política de Privacidad</a> (en inglés).
    </p>

    {
        showCopyright && (
            <p class="site-copyright">
                &copy; {year} José F. Reyes-Santana. Text and images CC BY 4.0, code MIT.
            </p>
        )
    }
</aside>

<style>
    .site-disclaimer {
        margin: 2rem auto 0;
        /* Bottom padding keeps the last line clear of the scroll-to-top button. */
        padding: 1rem 0 4rem;
        max-width: 60rem;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-6);
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        line-height: 1.55;
        color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    }

    .site-disclaimer p {
        margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
    }

    /* A little air between the English pair and the Spanish pair. */
    .site-disclaimer p[lang='es']:first-of-type {
        margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .site-disclaimer a {
        color: var(--sl-color-text-accent);
    }

    .site-copyright {
        margin-top: 1rem;
    }
</style>
